; Placeholder infantryman, ~1.8m, built from primitives. Origin at the feet.
; Everything above the waist hangs off Spine, which the player pitches so the
; weapon tracks where you are aiming. WeaponSocket is the attachment point --
; swapping weapons means reparenting a different scene onto it.
